y -- this is the seam future tickets will use for prompt-driven choices\n- `otherProvider()` is now exported (was private) since future tickets need it for the verifier menu default\n- Early config-exists check in init handler ensures future model prompts won't run if config already exists\n- The `'wx'` exclusive create in `writeStarter` is kept as a safety net for races\n\n### Notes for next attempt\n- The `starterFromModels` function has a subtle re-resolution of the finder provider when only verifier model is given (the `otherProvider` logic). This preserves the existing behavior where a missing finder model picks the other provider relative to the verifier.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":28,"newStart":1,"newLines":27,"lines":[" # Ticket 01: Starter role choice prefactor"," ","-## Plan","+## Implemented"," ","-The ticket is a refactor with no user-visible change. Key changes:","+### Files changed","+- `src/config/defaults.ts` -- added `SUGGESTED_MODELS` constants","+- `src/config/starter.ts` -- added `RoleChoice` type, refactored `starter()` to accept `RoleChoice`, added `starterFromModels()` backward-compat wrapper, `choiceFromModel()` helper, exported `otherProvider()`, updated `UnplaceableModelError` to use constants","+- `src/cli/init.ts` -- uses `starterFromModels`, added early config-exists check after git toplevel resolution","+- `test/config/starter.ts` -- tests for constants, RoleChoice-based starter, starterFromModels backward compat, UnplaceableModelError using constants","+- `test/cli/init.ts` -- test for early config-exists rejection"," ","-1. Add suggested model ID constants to `src/config/defaults.ts`","-2. Introduce a `RoleChoice` type (built-in provider + model) as input to `starter()`","-3. Refactor `starter()` to accept `RoleChoice` per role instead of two model strings","-4. Update `UnplaceableModelError` example text to use the new constants","-5. Map flags in `init.ts` onto the new `RoleChoice` input","-6. `init` checks confi